  TutorialStepIndex: 15
  DialogueList:
  - "Notice how the shield token is placed on the centert? That\u2019s the hallmark
    of a persistent item: it stays visible and active for every player\u2019s turn
    until destroyed or round gets resolved."
  - If you leave it untouched, I will stroll off without a scratch when the scores
    are tallied.
